COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.fact_wallet_transaction.amount IS 'Amount of the entry, always positive, in currency_code; entry_type gives the direction.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.fact_wallet_transaction.currency_code IS 'ISO 4217 currency of the amount(s) in this row, three capital letters.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.fact_wallet_transaction.reference_type IS 'What the entry paid for or came from (recharge, profile_download, ...).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.fact_wallet_transaction.recorded_timestamp IS 'When the entry was written to the ledger (UTC).';

-- audit.action_catalogue
COMMENT ON COLUMN audit.action_catalogue.id IS 'Surrogate primary key (64-bit identity). Never reused, never shown to users.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN audit.action_catalogue.code IS 'Stable machine-readable code (lower case), unique within the table.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN audit.action_catalogue.sensitive_class IS 'Which of the 14 sensitive action classes this action evidences (docs/phase-1-discover/05-audit-event-matrix.md).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN audit.action_catalogue.trail IS 'One of: audit_event, domain_ledger.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN audit.action_catalogue.description IS 'What the action means, in one line.';
